    "title": "Turn a company challenge into a robotics project",
    "seconds": 45,
    "notes": "Here is one project that makes the idea concrete: robot navigation. A company could propose a task such as moving from a starting point to a destination while avoiding obstacles. Our current grid simulator gives beginners a simple place to start. Teams write movement commands, save their program, run it, and inspect the replay. They can see whether the goal was reached, how many commands they used, and where a collision happened. After feedback, they change the program and try again. Those attempts make progress visible. This is the project journey we want to support: from a clear problem to a working solution and evidence of improvement. Partner-led hardware challenges would be a later step.",
